<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Password Reset Request</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #2c3e50; background-color: #ecf0f1; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: #2c3e50; color: #ffffff; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px solid #c0392b; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .content { padding: 40px 35px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 35px; background: #e74c3c; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 3px; margin: 25px 0; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
    .button:hover { background: #c0392b; }
    .warning { background: #fff8e1; border-left: 3px solid #ffa000; padding: 15px 20px; margin: 25px 0; color: #666; }
    .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 25px 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #7f8c8d; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
    .url-box { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 12px; border-radius: 3px; word-break: break-all; color: #3498db; font-size: 11px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 15px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      
      <p>We have received a request to reset the password for your UniRooms account. To proceed with resetting your password, please click the button below:</p>
      
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="button">Reset Password</a>
      </div>
      
      <p>Alternatively, you may copy and paste the following link into your web browser:</p>
      <div class="url-box">{{resetUrl}}</div>
      
      <div class="warning">
        <strong>Important Notice:</strong><br>
        This password reset link will expire in <strong>{{expiryTime}}</strong>. If you did not request a password reset, please disregard this email. Your password will remain unchanged.
      </div>
      
      <p>If you continue to experience issues accessing your account, please contact our support team for assistance.</p>
      
      <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The UniRooms Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p><strong>UniRooms</strong> - Student Accommodation Platform</p>
      <p>© {{year}} UniRooms. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Email: support@pgfinder.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
